Deployment #1038 for payment-service failed in production.

Failure:
npm dependency resolution error.

Root cause:
payment-sdk 4.1.0 was incompatible with auth-sdk 7.3.0.

Infrastructure change:
Node.js version was upgraded from 20.11 to 20.15.

Resolution:
